        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its unique blend of <strong>cel shading and stylized art direction</strong>, <i>A Package For Space</i> throws you into a devastated world where survival is never guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, you will have to face the environment, creatures, anomalies… <strong>and above all, time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the remains of civilization, gather resources, find food and water, build your shelter, and craft the equipment you need to survive another day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself, adapt to <strong>dynamic weather</strong>, and learn from your mistakes. In this world, every mistake can cost you dearly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But time keeps moving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is coming. And when everything changes, you will have a choice to make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you stay and face what is coming, trying to save this world… or choose to flee toward the stars?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the most of everything you can before it is too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Because sooner or later, you may have to prepare… a package for space</strong>🚀</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival is only the beginning.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The countdown has begun.</strong></h2>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its unique blend of <strong>cel shading and stylized art direction</strong>, <i>A Package For Space</i> throws you into a devastated world where survival is never guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, you will have to face the environment, creatures, anomalies… <strong>and above all, time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the remains of civilization, gather resources, find food and water, build your shelter, and craft the equipment you need to survive another day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself, adapt to <strong>dynamic weather</strong>, and learn from your mistakes. In this world, every mistake can cost you dearly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But time keeps moving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is coming. And when everything changes, you will have a choice to make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you stay and face what is coming, trying to save this world… or choose to flee toward the stars?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the most of everything you can before it is too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Because sooner or later, you may have to prepare… a package for space</strong>🚀</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival is only the beginning.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The countdown has begun.</strong></h2>",
